* Passing transistor-level reference using a differential comparator bank.
.subckt fa_inv a y vdd vss
XP y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN y a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=2 nf=1
.ends fa_inv

.subckt fa_nand2 a b y vdd vss
XP1 y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP2 y b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN1 y a nx vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN2 nx b vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
.ends fa_nand2

.subckt fa_tg a b en enb vdd vss
XN a en b vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=32 nf=8
XP a enb b vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=64 nf=16
.ends fa_tg

.subckt fa_nand4 a b c d y vdd vss
XP1 y a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP2 y b vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP3 y c vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XP4 y d vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=1
XN1 y a n1 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN2 n1 b n2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN3 n2 c n3 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XN4 n3 d vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
.ends fa_nand4

.subckt fa_comp clk vinp vinn outp outn vdd vss
* StrongARM latch: outp/outn precharge high, outn falls when vinp > vinn
XTAIL tail clk vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=32 nf=8
XIN1 dx vinp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.18 w=16 nf=4
XIN2 dy vinn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.18 w=16 nf=4
XNL1 outn outp dx vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XNL2 outp outn dy vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPL1 outn outp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPL2 outp outn vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC1 outn clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC2 outp clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC3 dx clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
XPC4 dy clk vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2
.ends fa_comp

.subckt fa_sr sn rn q qb vdd vss
XG1 sn qb q vdd vss fa_nand2
XG2 rn q qb vdd vss fa_nand2
.ends fa_sr

.subckt flash4_xor a b y vdd vss
X1 a b n1 vdd vss fa_nand2
X2 a n1 n2 vdd vss fa_nand2
X3 b n1 n3 vdd vss fa_nand2
X4 n2 n3 y vdd vss fa_nand2
.ends flash4_xor

.subckt flash_adc_4bit clk dout3 dout2 dout1 dout0 vss vdd vinn vinp vrefn vrefp
* Differential threshold ladder, 112.5 mV steps from 0 to 1.8 V.
RL1 s1 vrefn 100
RL2 s2 s1 100
RL3 s3 s2 100
RL4 s4 s3 100
RL5 s5 s4 100
RL6 s6 s5 100
RL7 s7 s6 100
RL8 s8 s7 100
RL9 s9 s8 100
RL10 s10 s9 100
RL11 s11 s10 100
RL12 s12 s11 100
RL13 s13 s12 100
RL14 s14 s13 100
RL15 s15 s14 100
RL16 vrefp s15 100
* The external clock is the conversion clock; its inverse is the sample clock.
XCLK clk clks vdd vss fa_inv

* Shared differential top-plate track-and-hold.
XTGP vinp vhp clks clk vdd vss fa_tg
XTGN vinn vhn clks clk vdd vss fa_tg
CHP vhp s8 20p
CHN vhn s8 20p
R1PA vhp vp1 200k
R1PB s15 vp1 200k
R1NA vhn vn1 200k
R1NB s1 vn1 200k
XC1 clk vp1 vn1 cp1 cn1 vdd vss fa_comp
XS1 cn1 cp1 q1 qb1 vdd vss fa_sr
R2PA vhp vp2 200k
R2PB s14 vp2 200k
R2NA vhn vn2 200k
